# Klemsan KLEA 110P/ECRAS/POWYS.
# Converted automatically from the Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST); see ATTRIBUTION.md.
# Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation.
# Corrections are welcome (CONTRIBUTING.md). Remove @x_status once this table has been checked against the manual.
# | Klemsan KLEA 110P / ECRAS / POWYS Shared Register Map (Modbus RTU RS-485)
# | 
# | Source: klemsan-klea110p-ecras-powys-user-manual-en.pdf (Section 4, pp.33-44)
# | Models: KLEA 110P (Energy Analyzer), ECRAS 200/220 (Electronic Multimeter),
# | POWYS 3100/3101 (Rail Mounted Energy Analyzer)
# | Note: Ecras 200, Ecras 220, Powys 3100, Powys 3101 support RS485. Not all
# | addresses may be available on every model variant.
# | Protocol: Modbus RTU; FC03 read, FC10 write
# | All registers 32-bit (2 Modbus words each); address stride +2 per entry.
# | Types: float = IEEE 754 f32; 32 bit integer = u32 (settings/counters) or s32 (n/a here)
# | Addresses are 0-based PDU word addresses.
@mbmap=1
@vendor=Klemsan
@model=KLEA 110P/ECRAS/POWYS
@description=3-phase energy analyzer / multimeter, Modbus RTU. Shared map for KLEA 110P, ECRAS 200/220, POWYS 3100/3101. All registers 32-bit (stride +2). Phase measurements 0-58 (V/I/PF/P/Q/S/THDV/THDI per phase, f32 RO); common 60-76 (avg V/I/total P/Q/S/freq/neutral, f32 RO); harmonics 78-268 (odd 1st-31st voltage+current per phase, f32 RO); max 270-346 / min 348-424 (same structure, f32 RO); alarm flags at 426 (u32 bitmask RO, 32 bits); demand 428-458 (current/active/reactive/apparent per phase+total, f32 RO); digital input/hour/interruption counters 460-468 (u32 R/W); energy meters 470-532 (T1/T2 import/export active+reactive, total+per-phase, u32 R/W); device settings 534-590 (CTR/VTR/connection/relay/demand/password/comms/DIO/pulse, u32/f32 R/W); alarm limits 592-652 (V-LN/V-LL/I/IN/cosφ/PF/freq high+low+hyst+delay, f32/u32 R/W); reset commands 1000-1014 (WO); save 2000 (WO); relay control 4000-4004 (WO); counter enable 5000 (WO).
@source=Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST), modbus-library/klemsan-ecras-powys.toml; Source: klemsan-klea110p-ecras-powys-user-manual-en.pdf (Section 4, pp.33-44). Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation
@byte_order=ABCD
@address_base=0
@x_status=unverified
@x_origin=omniconsole

